# Project Guidelines — Cursor

Refer to [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the canonical single source of truth for all standards.

- **Stack:** Node.js 22+, TypeScript Strict (zero `any`), Zod, Vitest.
- **Package Manager:** `pnpm` exclusively.
- **OpenAPI SSoT:** All ERP interactions must go through `@fatturafacile/openapi-sdk`.
- **Multi-Tenancy:** Maintain strict context isolation (`tenant`, `user`, `company`, `permissions`).
- **Validation Commands:**
  - `pnpm run typecheck`
  - `pnpm run lint`
  - `pnpm run test`
